  "body": "See [the changelog](https://spec.matrix.org/v1.9/changelog/#v19) (note that I stripped out spec clarifications).\r\n\r\nThis also requires us to finish support for Matrix v1.8: see #16176.\r\n\r\n# Client-Server API\r\n\r\n## Backwards Compatible Changes\r\n\r\n* [x] Add the `m.rule.suppress_edits` default push rule, as per [MSC3958](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/3958).\r\n  * #16113\r\n",
